   "modified": "2026-10-27T00:00:00Z",
   "title": "CLM - CC_lim, the product of two datasets' CC* values, is the maximum correlation expected from noise alone",
   "description": {
    "@type": "Item",
    "format": "text/plain",
    "content": "If the pairwise map correlation (CC_pair) falls below CC_lim in a resolution shell, the two maps differ beyond noise in that shell."
   },
