   "modified": "2026-10-27T00:00:00Z",
   "title": "CLM - Humidity-controlled Mac1 crystals from one team are highly isomorphous with very low mosaicity",
   "description": {
    "@type": "Item",
    "format": "text/plain",
    "content": "Low mosaicity indicates no dehydration stress during mounting and lets diffuse scattering be measured close to Bragg peaks."
   },
   "creator": "dew:creator",
