    "mira:Claim"
   ],
   "created": "2026-10-27T00:00:00Z",
   "modified": "2026-10-27T00:00:00Z",
   "title": "CLM - Larger crystals are the most direct route to a stronger reproducible diffuse signal",
   "description": {
    "@type": "Item",
    "format": "text/plain",
    "content": "Dose limits rule out more flux or longer exposures, so a larger illuminated volume is the remaining way to boost signal for a given dose."
   },
   "creator": "dew:creator",
   "bibliographicCitation": "Zielinski et al. 2026, doi:10.82153/hrpy-t681. Results: 'Crystal Size', Figure 6; Discussion, paragraph 2"
  },
  {
   "@id": "dew:c12",
   "@type": [
    "dew:schema-Claim",
    "mira:Claim"
   ],
   "created": "2026-10-27T00:00:00Z",
   "modified": "2026-10-27T00:00:00Z",
   "title": "CLM - Radiation damage leaves a measurable signature in the diffuse signal",
   "description": {
    "@type": "Item",
    "format": "text/plain",
    "content": "This gives a diagnostic for dose effects when screening data. The authors also identify a low-dose regime where damage is negligible relative to other errors."
   },
   "creator": "dew:creator",
   "bibliographicCitation": "Zielinski et al. 2026, doi:10.82153/hrpy-t681. Results: 'X-ray Dose', Figure 5; Discussion, paragraph 3"
  },
  {
   "@id": "dew:c13",
   "@type": [
    "dew:schema-Claim",
    "mira:Claim"
   ],
   "created": "2026-10-27T00:00:00Z",
   "modified": "2026-10-27T00:00:00Z",
   "title": "CLM - Global radiation damage acts as a resolution-dependent rescaling of the anisotropic pattern",
   "description": {
    "@type": "Item",
    "format": "text/plain",
    "content": "The simplest elastic-lattice model: dose raises the effective temperature or lowers stiffness, which in the one-phonon approximation rescales the pattern as B rises. The paper's data go against this."
   },
   "creator": "dew:creator",
   "bibliographicCitation": "Zielinski et al. 2026, doi:10.82153/hrpy-t681. Discussion, paragraph 3",
   "references": [
    "https://doi.org/10.1107/s1399004715013838",
    "https://doi.org/10.1038/s41467-023-36734-3"
   ]
  },
  {
