   "title": "EVD - Signal reaches noise at 1.8-2 Å for single crystals and at 1.6 Å for the three-crystal merge",
   "description": {
    "@type": "Item",
    "format": "text/plain",
    "content": "Signal-to-noise is the noise-corrected anisotropic RMS intensity over the RMS propagated error, and rises with each added crystal."
   },
   "creator": "dew:creator",
   "bibliographicCitation": "Zielinski et al. 2026, doi:10.82153/hrpy-t681. Results: 'Multi-Crystal Datasets', Figure 3b",
