   "title": "EVD - Paratone-N without a sleeve: Wilson B 20.5 vs 13.1 Å², mosaicity 0.120° vs 0.014°, c 39.48 vs 40.20 Å",
   "description": {
    "@type": "Item",
    "format": "text/plain",
    "content": "Every Bragg quality indicator was worse than the humidity-controlled references, consistent with dehydration during mounting."
