   "title": "STU - Four high-quality multi-crystal Mac1 datasets, two per team",
   "description": {
    "@type": "Item",
    "format": "text/plain",
    "content": "East: CHESS ID7B2, 2025-09-24 (3 crystals) and 2025-11-05 (2). West: ALS 8.3.1, 2025-10-15 (3) and 2025-11-25 (2). Also SBGrid Databank 1301 to 1304."
   },
   "creator": "dew:creator",
   "bibliographicCitation": "Zielinski et al. 2026, doi:10.82153/hrpy-t681. Results: 'Optimized data collection procedure'; 'Four high-quality datasets'; Table 1"
