  {
   "@id": "dew:p1",
   "@type": [
    "dew:schema-Protocol",
    "mira:Protocol"
   ],
   "created": "2026-10-27T00:00:00Z",
   "modified": "2026-10-27T00:00:00Z",
   "title": "PRO - Mac1 expression, purification and seeded crystallization at UCSF and Cornell",
   "description": {
    "@type": "Item",
    "format": "text/plain",
    "content": "P4_3 Mac1 (residues 3-169) from E. coli, His-tag cleaved, 40 mg/mL. Sitting drops at UCSF and hanging drops at Cornell over 100 mM CHES pH 9.5 with PEG 3000; PEG and seed dilution tune crystal size."
   },
   "creator": "dew:creator",
   "bibliographicCitation": "Zielinski et al. 2026, doi:10.82153/hrpy-t681. Methods: 'Protein expression, purification, and crystallization'",
   "references": [
    "https://doi.org/10.1126/sciadv.abf8711",
    "https://doi.org/10.1126/sciadv.abo5083"
   ]
  },
  {
   "@id": "dew:p2",
   "@type": [
    "dew:schema-Protocol",
    "mira:Protocol"
   ],
   "created": "2026-10-27T00:00:00Z",
   "modified": "2026-10-27T00:00:00Z",
   "title": "PRO - Humidity-controlled harvesting into plastic capillaries",
   "description": {
    "@type": "Item",
    "format": "text/plain",
    "content": "Harvested in a MiTeGen SLEEC chamber (~100% RH) or humidified gas stream (~90% RH), with Kapton loops in MicroRT capillaries and well solution 2-4 mm from the crystal."
   },
   "creator": "dew:creator",
   "bibliographicCitation": "Zielinski et al. 2026, doi:10.82153/hrpy-t681. Results: 'Optimized data collection procedure'; Methods: 'Data collection'",
   "references": [
    "https://www.sciencedirect.com/science/chapter/bookseries/abs/pii/S0076687923002380"
   ]
  },
  {
   "@id": "dew:p3",
   "@type": [
    "dew:schema-Protocol",
    "mira:Protocol"
   ],
   "created": "2026-10-27T00:00:00Z",
   "modified": "2026-10-27T00:00:00Z",
   "title": "PRO - Low-dose room-temperature diffuse data collection with matched background",
   "description": {
    "@type": "Item",
    "format": "text/plain",
    "content": "~100 µm beam, about 10^11 photons/s, shutterless 0.1° frames over ~720°. A 360° background is taken 100-300 µm along the spindle at the same fluence per degree. Datasets are truncated until B decay is below 2 Å²."
   },
   "creator": "dew:creator",
   "bibliographicCitation": "Zielinski et al. 2026, doi:10.82153/hrpy-t681. Results: 'Optimized data collection procedure'; Methods: 'Data collection'",
   "references": [
    "https://doi.org/10.1038/s41467-020-14933-6",
    "https://www.sciencedirect.com/science/chapter/bookseries/abs/pii/S0076687923002380"
   ]
  },
  {
   "@id": "dew:p4",
   "@type": [
    "dew:schema-Protocol",
    "mira:Protocol"
   ],
   "created": "2026-10-27T00:00:00Z",
   "modified": "2026-10-27T00:00:00Z",
   "title": "PRO - DIALS Bragg processing then mdx2 diffuse integration, scaling and merging",
   "description": {
    "@type": "Item",
    "format": "text/plain",
    "content": "2x2x4 oversampled grid, background correction, joint scaling, symmetry averaging. The isotropic part is a trimmed mean in 0.01 Å⁻¹ shells and is subtracted to give the anisotropic map."
   },
   "creator": "dew:creator",
   "bibliographicCitation": "Zielinski et al. 2026, doi:10.82153/hrpy-t681. Methods: 'Data processing'",
   "references": [
    "https://doi.org/10.1107/s2059798324002705",
    "https://doi.org/10.1002/pro.4224"
   ]
  },
  {
   "@id": "dew:p5",
   "@type": [
    "dew:schema-Protocol",
    "mira:Protocol"
   ],
   "created": "2026-10-27T00:00:00Z",
   "modified": "2026-10-27T00:00:00Z",
   "title": "PRO - CC1/2, CC* and CC_lim statistics on anisotropic maps per resolution shell",
   "description": {
    "@type": "Item",
    "format": "text/plain",
    "content": "Random half-datasets give CC1/2 and CC*. CC_lim is the product of two datasets' CC*. All CCs use the anisotropic pattern because the isotropic part inflates them."
   },
   "creator": "dew:creator",
   "bibliographicCitation": "Zielinski et al. 2026, doi:10.82153/hrpy-t681. Methods: 'Data processing'; 'Derivation of CC_lim'",
   "references": [
    "https://doi.org/10.1073/pnas.1416744111",
    "https://doi.org/10.1126/science.1218231"
   ]
  },
  {
